  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched from a clutch of eggs abandoned near the Snail Biker's Hideout, Cinder was raised on petrol fumes and recycled engine oil. This upbringing left him a bit... crispy around the edges, but also instilled a loyalty to the biker gang that amounts to absolute obsession.",
    "class": "Pyromaniac Mechanic",
    "name": "Cinder",
    "personality": "Loyal to a fault, Cinder would waddle through a lake of fire for his biker buddies. He's got a touch of pyromania thanks to a childhood fascination with the biker's flaming exhaust pipes. He also has an irrational attachment to his old stuffed burt doll, which he carries everywhere, and talks to.",
